OSX
---
opengl, openal should already installed (system frameworks)
don't forget to update SDK (commandline tools), when upgrading OS: xcode-select --install

when using XCode
disable 'New Build System' or 'clean' command will not working anymore. [File->Project Settings->Build System]
set execution directory by 'edit scheme'. it's the button aside the play/stop buttons in top left.

sudo ln -s /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk/usr/include/* /usr/local/include/
xcrun --show-sdk-path
export SDKROOT=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk/
export SDKROOT=/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk/

install brew first: /usr/bin/ruby -e "$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/master/install)"
brew install pkg-config
cp /opt/homebrew/bin/pkg-config /usr/local/bin

sudo easy_install pip && sudo pip install dmgbuild

compile freetype
  download latest source
  ./configure --enable-static --without-zlib --without-bzip2
  make
  sudo make install

in denise root folder:
make
make install

LINUX
-----
install following dependencies if you haven't already

GTK+ 3: apt-get install libgtk-3-dev
OpenGL: apt-get install mesa-common-dev
OpenAL: apt-get install libopenal-dev
Pulseaudio: apt-get install libpulse-dev
SDL2: apt-get install libsdl2-dev
Udev: apt-get install libudev-dev
